  "notes": {
   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-tautulli/compare/develop-dd032e1d-ls10...develop-bf4deaa7-ls11",
   "upstream": "Read each notifier's newest notify_log row with an index seek\n\nget_notifiers() joined notify_log and grouped by notifier for the last\ntriggered time. The join read every log row. The settings Notification\nAgents table and the get_notifiers API waited for it.\n\n**Measurement**\nOn a real database copy with 875,205 log rows and 30 notifiers the join\ntook 3132 ms. Per-notifier subqueries took under 8 ms and returned the\nsame rows. They read one entry of idx_notify_log_notifier_id each.\n\n**Change**\nlast_triggered and last_success come from two correlated subqueries.\nA tie in the same second now picks the row written last. The join\npicked an arbitrary row.\n\n**Tests**\ntests/test_notifiers_last_triggered.py checks the values, the tie, the\nnotifier filter, and that query work stays flat as the log grows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/Tautulli/Tautulli/commit/bf4deaa740e391c702a5b1bfe89d5960d96188d5"
  },
